      "content": "so u mentioned that some people see it as \"discriminatory\" to give benefits based on race. doesn't that sound kind of like the same logic used to argue against civil rights protections in the past? i'm just trying to understand if these arguments are seen as valid legal points or if they're generally dismissed as just being excuses to avoid addressing historical harm.",
